#### Preference Embedding
- User preference: concise, direct responses without filler
- Prefer Read-ONLY diagnosis identifying first point of failure before any fix
- Want short report and explicit STOP when finished
- Verify identity before killing processes
- Care about honesty under uncertainty — claim unverified rather than assumed true
- Expect conclusions tied to concrete evidence (checksums, PIDs, measured values)
- Flag latent risks separately from active bug rather than blended into it

